        "description": {
          "lang": "en",
          "value": "2 Line will continue operating between Downtown Redmond to South Bellevue stations with 10 minutes between trains. Link shuttle buses will run approximately every 10 to 15 minutes between South Bellevue and Int'l District/Chinatown stations.  \r\n\n2 Line trains will not operate from the International District/Chinatown to Lynnwood City Center stations. Please use 1 Line trains. If you seek to travel through the 2 Line alignment to Bellevue and Redmond, transfer to Link shuttle buses at the International District/Chinatown station.  \r\n\n1 Line trains will operate every eight minutes between Lynnwood City Center and Federal Way Downtown stations.   \r\n\nPlease plan ahead for additional travel time.  \r\n\nSelect the link below to view our alternative service options.  \r\n"
        },
